{"versions":[{"path":"versions/72871fbf-3535-4000-9b96-438ae15b497c/f192c0f62be5c81dabe4cca060b2928d8f663aa3ed176496cb005aa46add8964.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"72871fbf-3535-4000-9b96-438ae15b497c","revision":"sha256:f192c0f62be5c81dabe4cca060b2928d8f663aa3ed176496cb005aa46add8964","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"头发颜色属于哪种数据类型？\n\n原记录\n回忆材料将 C 项记为“Ordinary”。"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"Nominal","correct":true,"option_id":"0a4e7d9e-d0c6-4881-a536-79c4c22c9d93"},{"type":"text","content":"Numerical","correct":false,"option_id":"c2aa8861-9bc5-4675-bcbd-25857018d370"},{"type":"text","content":"Ordinary","correct":false,"option_id":"bfbac9a6-35e2-46eb-bd0e-8c0bf6f77463"},{"type":"text","content":"—","correct":false,"option_id":"541c2b28-2acd-44ea-ab84-1f70703bdfb5"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"头发颜色是无自然顺序的类别, 属于 nominal data (名义变量)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/0ae2486d-4718-4187-8a64-7afa2b8a66c3/0f357edf95a5dda188b01c0281645cf8d69d4cb1a0a7b91812073b3d54a8c87e.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"0ae2486d-4718-4187-8a64-7afa2b8a66c3","revision":"sha256:0f357edf95a5dda188b01c0281645cf8d69d4cb1a0a7b91812073b3d54a8c87e","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"请问这个分布图表示什么？"},{"type":"image","src":"../../assets/c7a9444a90b17aa84c49bcd1036e35a0ec76f1785a1b91841aa3c36813acb9a0.png","alt":"原回忆材料中的偏态示意图"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"Negative skewed","correct":true,"option_id":"6fd66f8a-fe7b-42f8-8f7c-7ade0bb4f99b"},{"type":"text","content":"Positive skewed","correct":false,"option_id":"ad990daa-93d7-4598-acdc-506cbf381e95"},{"type":"text","content":"—","correct":false,"option_id":"692979a6-3686-4927-aef8-e0b993e34ec1"},{"type":"text","content":"—","correct":false,"option_id":"29c6f6da-f5fa-4930-98fe-21e9de1c51ea"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"已核看原图, 左侧长尾, 为 negative skewed / 左偏分布"}]}}},{"path":"versions/43fcefee-4e45-4336-94cf-4f14bfc3f2df/835aad06b45092b196fb3e95fec933a55c81ec9c904b3887034557a712dd1475.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"43fcefee-4e45-4336-94cf-4f14bfc3f2df","revision":"sha256:835aad06b45092b196fb3e95fec933a55c81ec9c904b3887034557a712dd1475","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"给出一组 x 和 y 的数据，判断 x 与 y 的众数、均值和中位数之间的关系。数据如下："},{"type":"table","headers":["x","y"],"rows":[["1","11"],["2","12"],["3","13"],["4","14"],["5","15"]],"align":["right","right"]}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"mean(x) + 10 = mean(y)","correct":true,"option_id":"a1ef9eed-5559-477e-8167-474853d610d1"},{"type":"text","content":"SD(x) < SD(y)","correct":false,"option_id":"e3a06016-fe41-4222-a74a-0d35d9dc320a"},{"type":"text","content":"SD(x) > SD(y)","correct":false,"option_id":"89212d2a-a6a9-4314-b5d1-817579f1cf77"},{"type":"text","content":"—","correct":false,"option_id":"4626e4c3-c064-495e-a38d-923acc13584c"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"y=x+10, 所以均值和中位数均增加10, 标准差不变\n本题均值分别为3和13, 中位数分别为3和13, 样本标准差均为√2.5≈1.5811; 每个数仅出现一次, 无唯一众数"}]}}},{"path":"versions/0cbf2602-e3cc-4771-bf0b-dfdb36f4f42b/dbec55405a9a2847091a9b4fd87289ad9f79555dde5a7ca45cda843cf28e677b.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"0cbf2602-e3cc-4771-bf0b-dfdb36f4f42b","revision":"sha256:dbec55405a9a2847091a9b4fd87289ad9f79555dde5a7ca45cda843cf28e677b","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"买保险的人中男性的概率为 80%。6 个人买保险，其中 3 个人是男性的概率是多少？回忆材料提到题目提供了二项分布表。"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"该数据是 p = 0.2 时，6 选 3 的概率。","correct":true,"option_id":"bbb6a86c-8cda-4c92-89eb-c3b9dc6e5659"},{"type":"text","content":"—","correct":false,"option_id":"22d7aa94-f29e-450b-802e-3bb0706e61e0"},{"type":"text","content":"—","correct":false,"option_id":"ebb1d7a2-7ba2-4f1e-b2f3-7052287ceea1"},{"type":"text","content":"dpois(2, 3)","correct":false,"option_id":"c38c7637-9119-449f-92a9-e7c17df0ba15"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"若6人独立且男性概率相同, X~Binomial(6,0.8), P(X=3)=C(6,3)×0.8³×0.2³=0.08192\n该值也等于 Binomial(6,0.2) 恰为3的概率, 所以已记录选项中A正确; B,C内容缺失"}]}}},{"path":"versions/0e55aa16-57f5-4490-aa2e-6d6277729704/2f83fe5d78a196b7e0e373c761f7c9ed3ac513e84d65aacebdf8a691eae47b61.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"0e55aa16-57f5-4490-aa2e-6d6277729704","revision":"sha256:2f83fe5d78a196b7e0e373c761f7c9ed3ac513e84d65aacebdf8a691eae47b61","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"什么情况下应降低检测手段的假阳性（false positive）？"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"疾病传播力太广","correct":false,"option_id":"0ecfaec9-5e57-46a8-8d06-e7ff298b4f8d"},{"type":"text","content":"疾病在早期容易控制","correct":false,"option_id":"fa51886f-4875-4a35-887a-621c4c747da6"},{"type":"text","content":"疾病为急性，造成的伤害很大","correct":false,"option_id":"9ae0194d-8c3b-47c1-882a-f921290dede4"},{"type":"text","content":"治疗成本很高","correct":true,"option_id":"e3d75bff-c870-4b21-8cb9-6baa94bafd5d"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"治疗成本很高时, 假阳性会使未患病者接受不必要且昂贵的治疗, 因而更重视特异度并降低假阳性率"}]}}},{"path":"versions/704fce94-48cc-4fdd-bb7a-3c375298447e/555991f716d56ca4769aeff11044b0936ca31782833fd02b2a43d5bd6ec0610b.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"704fce94-48cc-4fdd-bb7a-3c375298447e","revision":"sha256:555991f716d56ca4769aeff11044b0936ca31782833fd02b2a43d5bd6ec0610b","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"t-test 可以用于哪些情况？"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"One-sample t-test","correct":false,"option_id":"30028c26-f09f-4922-87b4-5f0ffb21c55f"},{"type":"text","content":"Two-sample independent t-test","correct":false,"option_id":"f24fa724-2998-45dc-8c70-c4eb5a446de1"},{"type":"text","content":"Paired t-test","correct":false,"option_id":"6036a489-42cb-4335-9ec3-be8528122171"},{"type":"text","content":"以上三种都是","correct":true,"option_id":"b1966112-fa68-4628-ae68-e11c88886ac8"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"单样本t检验, 独立双样本t检验, 配对t检验均属于t检验; 配对t检验实际检验配对差值的总体均值"}]}}},{"path":"versions/4c024fbd-b70f-4051-a4a2-3b7ebbdd1244/c62f93748a774f1d0380d82662f1a8c21b43a15d30308474fe9dc8eb95441081.json","value":{"schema_version":1,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"4c024fbd-b70f-4051-a4a2-3b7ebbdd1244","revision":"sha256:c62f93748a774f1d0380d82662f1a8c21b43a15d30308474fe9dc8eb95441081","kind":"mcqs","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"哪些网站可用于查看蛋白质的三维结构？"}],"options":[{"type":"text","content":"wwPDB","correct":false,"option_id":"84f6c388-7b8f-4edd-b652-9f77c2a951af"},{"type":"text","content":"PDBe","correct":false,"option_id":"1e81b69e-68d5-4ae8-b80e-117256369208"},{"type":"text","content":"PDBj","correct":false,"option_id":"6f559d86-5ef7-4f53-907e-1eaa7903497d"},{"type":"text","content":"以上都可以","correct":true,"option_id":"63e648f7-c670-4779-8520-e9b48b2ccd4d"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"wwPDB维护PDB档案, PDBe和PDBj提供结构访问与可视化, 所列入口均可用于查找蛋白质三维结构\n核验来源: [wwPDB关于PDB档案的论文](https://doi.org/10.1093/nar/gky949)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/e70b7838-12c8-4da1-b2e2-05944eae3015/aa6728da5cbfce9d17ec686ddf1ea9a60690eb6abb0adfbba2b0f228f701da89.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"e70b7838-12c8-4da1-b2e2-05944eae3015","revision":"sha256:aa6728da5cbfce9d17ec686ddf1ea9a60690eb6abb0adfbba2b0f228f701da89","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"给出 12 个乱序数字，求第 10 百分位数。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"待确认: 原资料缺少12个数, 不能算出具体数值\n先从小到大排序为 x(1),...,x(12). 若采用 nearest-rank, P10=x(ceil(12×0.10))=x(2); 若采用 (n+1)p 线性插值, 位置=1.3, P10=x(1)+0.3[x(2)-x(1)]. 百分位算法也需按课程规定确认"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7168567d-65ec-46b0-a9f0-ac0a08917f9f/28502181cad5cbddcbfda4cde47e498f2b665e3c84cb0594af229199fda0ae94.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"7168567d-65ec-46b0-a9f0-ac0a08917f9f","revision":"sha256:28502181cad5cbddcbfda4cde47e498f2b665e3c84cb0594af229199fda0ae94","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"题目给出不同年龄段人群的患病率，以及母亲患病后生出低出生体重孩子的比例，求在孩子低出生体重的条件下，母亲年龄小于 36 岁且患病的概率。回忆材料建议复习贝叶斯公式、全概率公式和条件概率。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"待确认: 缺少年龄构成, 分年龄患病率及低出生体重概率\n令 A 为母亲<36岁, D 为患病, L 为低出生体重. P(A∩D|L)=P(L|A∩D)P(D|A)P(A)/P(L)\n分母 P(L)=Σ年龄层a Σ疾病状态d P(L|a,d)P(d|a)P(a), 需同时包括未患病母亲的贡献"}]}}},{"path":"versions/b4594277-b3ab-470e-aed8-5272891cb4ac/9858d6bb3f57ae046599bf818773a2cfc7b0cdaead35f6e8660ef06c93d0e4e6.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"b4594277-b3ab-470e-aed8-5272891cb4ac","revision":"sha256:9858d6bb3f57ae046599bf818773a2cfc7b0cdaead35f6e8660ef06c93d0e4e6","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"给出一张表格，求 sensitivity。回忆者记下的定义为 P(test+ | disease+)；表格内容未能回忆。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"Sensitivity=TP/(TP+FN)=P(test+|disease+). 分母是真正患病者, 分子为其中检测阳性者\n原表缺失, 数值待确认"}]}}},{"path":"versions/a713d31c-c4a6-404f-9d00-89250e4d102c/3ae9d7331b29e29e09de567431fc6c5910974e776b1d9811509eccd2cf42ed7c.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"a713d31c-c4a6-404f-9d00-89250e4d102c","revision":"sha256:3ae9d7331b29e29e09de567431fc6c5910974e776b1d9811509eccd2cf42ed7c","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"给出一张以金标准检测结果为列、当前检测方法结果为行为的表格。某城市随机抽取 1000 人，已知该病在人群中的患病率为 5%，求当前检测方法会漏掉多少真正患病的人。表格数值未能回忆。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"真正患病者的期望数=1000×0.05=50, 漏诊期望人数=50×(1-sensitivity)=50×false-negative rate\n检测表数值缺失, 不能确定具体人数; 实际抽样人数也不必恰等于期望值"}]}}},{"path":"versions/afb72f86-9f09-4713-9d59-83a0fe8cdd27/381490f381a840f1e4152f697da48af7e9ec26ed665613252e38a2f9a2545c80.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"afb72f86-9f09-4713-9d59-83a0fe8cdd27","revision":"sha256:381490f381a840f1e4152f697da48af7e9ec26ed665613252e38a2f9a2545c80","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"以下哪种方法用于双样本非参数假设检验？完整题干和选项未记录。\n\n回忆者提示\n回忆材料建议选 Wilcoxon test，并提醒不要与非参数单因素方差分析混淆。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"若是两个独立样本的非参数比较, 通常采用 Wilcoxon rank-sum test / Mann-Whitney U test; 若是同一对象的配对数据, 采用 Wilcoxon signed-rank test\n原题独立/配对关系与选项未完整记录, 不能只凭“Wilcoxon test”唯一确定检验"}]}}},{"path":"versions/0b07554b-b2b5-40ef-be8e-838472fc1890/daedc4408b6d422f60567fd260c836eec67b7a2e5c8069c73245eefb2e122961.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"0b07554b-b2b5-40ef-be8e-838472fc1890","revision":"sha256:daedc4408b6d422f60567fd260c836eec67b7a2e5c8069c73245eefb2e122961","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"哪个网站可用于预测蛋白质的三维结构？选项未能回忆。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"例如 SWISS-MODEL 可从序列进行蛋白质同源建模, 符合“预测三维结构”的要求\n原题选项缺失, 无法确定原卷期望的唯一网站名称\n核验来源: [SWISS-MODEL](https://swissmodel.expasy.org/)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/70610be5-3d20-4283-855e-ac82b36b5d21/2c9784ab1b2bc84e1c16fd0a9484fb086804e907ed142f08f1e68926cb3a7f17.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"70610be5-3d20-4283-855e-ac82b36b5d21","revision":"sha256:2c9784ab1b2bc84e1c16fd0a9484fb086804e907ed142f08f1e68926cb3a7f17","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"判断：JCR 网站可以查看期刊影响因子。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"正确. Journal Citation Reports (JCR) 提供期刊的 Journal Impact Factor 等指标\n核验来源: [Clarivate JCR产品说明](https://clarivate.com/academia-government/scientific-and-academic-research/research-funding-analytics/journal-citation-reports/)"}]}}},{"path":"versions/bf9dcf39-4427-422b-93f9-dc77074b9fcf/22dcb0511c56e9fa1cbe3e74a271704a8bc91143a94a89380d6ca6a8133e6f4f.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"bf9dcf39-4427-422b-93f9-dc77074b9fcf","revision":"sha256:22dcb0511c56e9fa1cbe3e74a271704a8bc91143a94a89380d6ca6a8133e6f4f","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"给出不同被试者使用某药物后的血压变化表格，研究团队想判断该药物能否降低血压。表格具体数据未能回忆。"},{"type":"table","headers":["被试者","治疗前","治疗后","差值"],"rows":[["1","—","—","—"],["2","—","—","—"],["3","—","—","—"],["4","—","—","—"],["5","—","—","—"]],"align":["left","right","right","right"]},{"type":"text","content":"1. 应使用什么检验方法分析该药物的降压作用？\n2. 计算 t statistic 并给出结论。\n3. 给出该药物能够降低血压的 p 值。\n\n回忆者估计\n回忆者记得 p 值约为 0.05—0.1，并认为在 α = 0.05 时未达到统计学显著；该数值来自回忆者记忆。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"1. 若治疗前后来自同一被试, 且配对差值近似正态, 用单侧配对t检验. 定义 d=治疗前-治疗后, H0: μd=0, H1: μd>0, 方向应事先确定\n2. t=d̄/(sd/√n), df=n-1. 若表中确有5名被试, df=4; 在α=0.05下临界值 t0.95,4≈2.1318, t超过临界值才拒绝H0\n3. p=P(Tdf≥tobs). 原始血压值缺失, t和p不能独立计算, 原回忆的0.05—0.1仅为未验证线索, 不作为数值答案"}]}}},{"path":"versions/00f09386-02db-4ae9-9790-bf6358ce5c7a/0f2aedca8f6c8b63400dac458d398c21b4e9fa0e4cb0e90c53a0fed52cd10b87.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"00f09386-02db-4ae9-9790-bf6358ce5c7a","revision":"sha256:0f2aedca8f6c8b63400dac458d398c21b4e9fa0e4cb0e90c53a0fed52cd10b87","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"线性回归题：给出 654 个观测点及 x、y 的和、平方和等统计量。\n\n\n1. 写出 y = bx + a 的拟合方程。\n2. 使用 F 检验判断回归直线是否显著。\n3. 给出自由度。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"1. 令 Lxx=Σx²-(Σx)²/654, Lyy=Σy²-(Σy)²/654, Lxy=Σxy-ΣxΣy/654. b=Lxy/Lxx, a=ȳ-bx̄, 拟合线 ŷ=bx+a\n2. H0: β1=0, H1: β1≠0. SSR=Lxy²/Lxx, SSE=Lyy-SSR, F=SSR/[SSE/652]. 在α水平比较 F 与 F1-α(1,652), 或使用右尾p值\n3. 回归df=1, 残差df=652, 总df=653\n统计量的具体数值未记录, 无法给数值方程或显著性结论"}]}}},{"path":"versions/6ffd5b69-f2a3-4e23-b28c-3f2f68768ff3/de04cf5d3da01e3eea5a0cb76356a45f227ac9af324a35bb236c50e169d6c095.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"6ffd5b69-f2a3-4e23-b28c-3f2f68768ff3","revision":"sha256:de04cf5d3da01e3eea5a0cb76356a45f227ac9af324a35bb236c50e169d6c095","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"一道单因素方差分析题，具体题干和数据未能回忆。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"待确认: 缺组数, 样本量和观测值\n单因素方差分析检验 H0: μ1=...=μk, H1: 至少一个总体均值不同. SSB=Σnj(x̄j-x̄)², SSW=ΣΣ(xij-x̄j)², F=[SSB/(k-1)]/[SSW/(N-k)], df=(k-1,N-k)\n需满足独立观测, 组内误差近似正态及方差齐性等前提; 缺数据不能计算F或下结论"}]}}}]}